MANDEL(1)

NAME
    mandel - display a Mandelbrot demo

SYNOPSIS
    mandel

DESCRIPTION
    Starts a graphical Mandelbrot set demo using the SmallOS framebuffer.
    The rendered fractal is cached in a user-space surface so cursor movement
    can redraw only the affected rectangle.

KEYS
    Arrow keys pan the view.

    + and -
        Zoom in and out.

    r
        Reset the view.

    q
        Quit and return to the shell.

MOUSE
    If a mouse is available, movement controls the on-screen cursor overlay.

SEE ALSO
    fractint(1), plasma(1), bmpview(1), mousetest(1)
